title: "EACE — Evidence-Anchored Agent Containment Evaluation"
version: "0.2.0-dev"
date-released: "2025-01-01"
type: software
abstract: >
  A local, adversarial research framework for testing agent capability
  boundaries, evidence integrity, reproducibility, and verifier validity.
  EACE is not a proof of AI containment or AI safety.
keywords:
